### Baroni API Test Collection
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension
### Click "Send Request" above each request to test

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api

### Variables (update these as needed)
@testContact = +1234567890
@testEmail = test@example.com
@testPassword = testpassword123
@authToken = YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN_HERE

### ========================================
### HEALTH & BASIC ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ========================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ========================================

### Register User
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "{{testContact}}",
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}",
  "fcmToken": "test-fcm-token"
}

### Login User
# @name login
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "{{testContact}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Get User Profile (requires auth)
GET {{apiUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Update FCM Token
PUT {{apiUrl}}/auth/fcm-token
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fcmToken": "new-fcm-token-here"
}

### ========================================
### CATEGORIES
### ========================================

### Get All Categories
GET {{apiUrl}}/category

### Get Category by ID
GET {{apiUrl}}/category/CATEGORY_ID_HERE

### ========================================
### STARS
### ========================================

### Get All Stars
GET {{apiUrl}}/star

### Get Stars with Filters
GET {{apiUrl}}/star?country=France&category=CATEGORY_ID

### Get Star Profile
GET {{apiUrl}}/star/STAR_ID_HERE

### Search Stars
GET {{apiUrl}}/star/search?q=star_name

### ========================================
### DASHBOARD
### ========================================

### Get Dashboard (requires auth)
GET {{apiUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Dashboard with Country Filter
GET {{apiUrl}}/dashboard?country=France
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ========================================
### APPOINTMENTS
### ========================================

### Get User Appointments (requires auth)
GET {{apiUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Create Appointment (requires auth)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "starId": "STAR_ID_HERE",
  "date": "2025-01-15",
  "time": "14:00",
  "message": "Hello, I'd like to book an appointment"
}

### ========================================
### LIVE SHOWS
### ========================================

### Get Live Shows
GET {{apiUrl}}/live-shows

### Get Live Show Details
GET {{apiUrl}}/live-shows/SHOW_ID_HERE

### ========================================
### SERVICES & DEDICATIONS
### ========================================

### Get Star Services
GET {{apiUrl}}/services?starId=STAR_ID_HERE

### Get Dedications
GET {{apiUrl}}/dedications?starId=STAR_ID_HERE

### Get Dedication Samples
GET {{apiUrl}}/dedication-samples?starId=STAR_ID_HERE

### ========================================
### FAVORITES
### ========================================

### Get User Favorites (requires auth)
GET {{apiUrl}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Add to Favorites (requires auth)
POST {{apiUrl}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "starId": "STAR_ID_HERE"
}

### Remove from Favorites (requires auth)
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/favorites/STAR_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ========================================
### RATINGS & REVIEWS
### ========================================

### Get Star Ratings
GET {{apiUrl}}/ratings?starId=STAR_ID_HERE

### Add Rating (requires auth)
POST {{apiUrl}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "starId": "STAR_ID_HERE",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Great experience!"
}

### ========================================
### TRANSACTIONS
### ========================================

### Get User Transactions (requires auth)
GET {{apiUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ========================================
### NOTIFICATIONS
### ========================================

### Get User Notifications (requires auth)
GET {{apiUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Mark Notification as Read (requires auth)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/notifications/NOTIFICATION_ID_HERE/read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ========================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS (requires admin role)
### ========================================

### Get Admin Dashboard (requires admin auth)
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All Users (admin only)
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ========================================
### ERROR TESTING
### ========================================

### Test 404 - Invalid Endpoint
GET {{apiUrl}}/invalid-endpoint

### Test 401 - Unauthorized
GET {{apiUrl}}/dashboard

### Test 400 - Bad Request
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invalid": "data"
}